OL,3,AUK and allies call on Israel to allow
OL,4,Arapid humanitarian access to Gaza
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK, Australia, Canada and Italy
OL,7,Fhave issued a joint statement urging
OL,8,FIsrael to "allow immediate, rapid and
OL,9,Funimpeded humanitarian access
OL,10,Fthroughout Gaza", where they say the
OL,11,Fsituation on the ground is "dire".
OL,13,FThe foreign ministers warn recent
OL,14,Ffloods have brought "further suffering"
OL,15,Fto the war-torn territory, which
OL,16,Frecently had its first winter storm.
OL,18,FThe statement says 150,000 tents and
OL,19,Fother vital supplies are being held at
OL,20,Fthe border.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
